io  is that it only comes in white instead  of having the option to have white or  black now white looks super cool super  clean but it is very hard to keep clean  here is my keyboard for the 12.9 inch it  is white and as you guys could see I  have a bunch of dirt lines stuff like  that that just built up and I don't just  take this outside in the park anywhere  where it's too dirty and believe it or  not I actually watch this thing first  with water and a microfiber cloth then  with alcohol and this is what's left it  was way dirtier than this and this stuff  right here does not want to come off so  if you're going to be using this thing  well that definitely is a downside I  wish they offered it in Black so with  all of that said do I think this is  worth 250 bucks and should you spend  your money on it well overall I love  some of the design features and  capabilities but I think that price  point is way too high now it is Sleek  it's fairly slim it's not that heavy but  that's just a lot of money and if you're  looking for an alternative Logitech just  launched their new keyboard which they  had for previous ones but they adjusted  it for the iPad 10 but unfortunately  Apple did not put it on their website  like they have the other ones you have  to get that directly from their website  and also link it down below maybe to  Amazon as well and that's probably  because they don't want to take away  sales from this keyboard because the  other one does have a lower angle it  does have backlighting it also uses that  SMART connector you can detach the  keyboard as well so it costs less money  it has more features it's not a cheap  Bluetooth only keyboard the only thing  is there your iPad pops into it which  does mean that you get extra protection  here all along the side AIDS so it's  also a little bit thicker but at that  price point I think that's definitely a  winner now overall if you have not  bought an iPad 10 just yet well I say  overall I would take the original  keyboard instead of this design yes it  has some limitations you can't detach  that keyboard but have the ability to  charge and having that backlighting and  being able to pick up a package for  under 600 bucks all together with an  iPad that is better instead of spending  700 I mean I think that is the smart  thing to do so that is my opinion you  guys let me know yours check out the  comparison between the iPad Air 5 and 4  compared to the iPad 10 right over there  click that Circle above to subscribe  This One Max and I'll see you in the  next one  [Music]  foreign

